// Bind one request's external ranges into the resident array.
// Thirteen borrowed bindings provide projections, constants, embedding rows,
// metadata, output, and mutable state. Core binding-table entries retain full
// 64-bit addresses. No host arithmetic or additional model dispatch is added.
